---
// One screen of a stepped milestone: the plate, the prompt, the content, the
// advance block. This is the markup firma2-setup-start-steps repeats per
// question, lifted so the Organizations and Funding sources steps render the
// same shape without each restating it. The shell (firma2-setup-stepper)
// finds the screen by `data-step` and never looks inside except for
// [data-step-next], [data-step-skip] and the prompt it focuses.
//
// THREE SLOTS. The default slot is the content; `advance` is the Next button
// (firma2-setup-step-next, whose words the stepper writes) and, when the screen
// can be passed unanswered, the ghost skip beside it. The advance block is a
// sticky footer bar (firma2-setup-steps.css): the section's last child, so it
// holds the viewport's bottom edge while the screen runs past it and rests
// under the content when the screen is short (Andy, 2026-09-24: "the main col
// is pushed down, which pushes down the next/skip buttons ... maybe in a
// sticky footer?"). The screen
// component that fills them owns the gating (`data-step-ready`), because only
// it knows what answered means. `lede` is one line under the prompt, for the
// fact the prompt leans on: the first screen of a walk says which documents
// named its cast, because without that the tiles read as a list setup made up
// (Andy, 2026-09-18: "it is unclear that those are suggestions based on the
// uploaded docs"). The prompt and its lede share a tight stack so the gap
// between them is a heading's, not a section's.
//
// `align="start"` is for content that is a table or a grid: the screen centers
// its prompt and choices, and a data surface inside it reads left to right.
import EsaIcon from '@esa/ecology/esa-icon.astro';
import '../shared/firma2-setup-steps.css';

interface Props {
  step: string;
  icon: string;
  prompt: string;
  align?: 'center' | 'start';
  /** Extra class on the section, for the step component's own hooks. */
  class?: string;
}

const { step, icon, prompt, align = 'center', class: className } = Astro.props;
---
<section
  class:list={['firma2-setup-steps__screen stack', className]}
  data-gap="lg"
  data-step={step}
  hidden
>
  <span class="firma2-setup-steps__icon"><EsaIcon name={icon} size="xl" /></span>
  <div class="stack firma2-setup-steps__heading" data-gap="sm">
    <h2 class="typography-display-sm firma2-setup-steps__prompt" tabindex="-1">{prompt}</h2>
    <slot name="lede" />
  </div>
  <div class:list={['stack', align === 'start' && 'firma2-setup-steps__body']} data-gap="md">
    <slot />
  </div>
  <div class="firma2-setup-steps__advance">
    <slot name="advance" />
  </div>
</section>
